{"last_link_id": 39, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 【音画同出-多图参考生视频】使用说明（MiniMax H3 本地 · 底层节点组版）\n\n文件：`音画同出-多图参考生视频-minimax_h3版.json`　输出目录：`ComfyUI_output/video/AIxiaomo_H3_r2v_*.mp4`\n\n## 一、三步出片\n1. 「① 提示词」写清楚 **画面 + 镜头 + 音频**：H3 是音画同出模型，\n   台词、音效、配乐都要写进提示词（可用 `[0s-2s] …` 分时间轴描述）。\n2. 「② 画面比例 / 像素」选比例、填百万像素（默认 0.4MP＝864×480）；「③ 视频时长」填秒。\n3. Queue。成片带声音，直接落在 `ComfyUI_output/video/`。\n\n## 二、与 v1.0（高层节点版）的区别\nv1.0 用高层节点 `MiniMax H3 Image to Video`（内部自动建 latent、写锚定）。\n本版拆成底层三件套，参数全可见、可任意组合：\n\n- **空 AV 潜空间**（Empty MiniMax H3 AV Latent）＝ 唯一画布来源（宽/高/帧数）\n- **提示词编码**（CLIPTextEncode + type=minimax 的 CLIPLoader）＝ t2va 的纯文本条件\n- **Add Guide（帧锚定）** ＝ 把一张图/一段音频硬锚定到任意帧号（负数从末尾数），\n  首帧、尾帧、任意秒插帧都是它，可串联多个\n- **ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3** ＝ 音视频 shift（默认 12/3＝模型默认，勿随意改）\n- **低显存/注意力补丁** ＝ head 分组注意力 + FFN 分块，降峰值显存，结果不变\n\n## 三、参数与注意事项\n1. **帧率**固定 24（H3 原生）；「④ 视频帧率」只影响成片封装帧率。\n2. **步数**在「采样步数 / 调度器」（默认 20）；接了加速 LoRA 才能降到 4~8。\n3. **(可选·默认Bypass) 节点**默认不生效，要用就右键取消 Bypass：\n   - `内存优化注意力`：本机已装 sageattention，取消 Bypass 可省显存；报错就 Bypass 回去。\n   - `锚定…`：接图 = 锁该帧画面；接音频 = 整条音轨替换生成音频。\n4. **锚定帧会按输出比例居中裁切**（Add Guide 的 cover-crop）。不想被裁，\n   就把「② 画面比例」调成与输入图一致的比例。\n5. 爆显存：像素降到 0.2~0.3MP、时长降到 2~3 秒，或步数调低先看效果。\n6. 想用加速 LoRA：见「工作流模型说明」里的下载链接，在扩散模型后加\n   `LoraLoaderModelOnly`，步数改 8 / 4。\n\n## 四、本流专属（多图参考生视频）\n- ①②③ 三张参考图＝身份/服装/场景参考；提示词里必须用 `<Picture 1>` `<Picture 2>`\n  `<Picture 3>` 指代，顺序与参考图槽位一致。\n- 条件节点是 `MiniMax H3 Reference to Video`（ref2va 模型）：\n  - `ref_image_size`：`match`（按生成画面像素对齐，快）／`max`（2048 短边，\n    身份最准但慢好几倍）。\n  - 槽位默认 3 个；要接更多图，在节点上右键 → Autogrow 增加（最多 9 张）。\n- 「(可选·默认Bypass) 时间点锚定」：接一张参考图 + 填 frame_idx（秒×24），\n  该秒画面会被硬钉住（官方 multiframe_reference 模板就是这种玩法）。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [860, 900], "pos": [-1661.5009765625, -873.7351684570312], "id": 31, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 模型下载链接（MiniMax H3 本地版）\n\n**Diffusion Model（本工作流已按用途选好）**\n- [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n  —— 文生视频 / 首帧 / 首尾帧\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n  —— 多图参考\n\n**VAE**\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**Text Encoder**\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**Lora（可选，加速；下载后接到扩散模型后面，步数改 8 / 4）**\n- 8 步 [minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n- 4 步 [minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_4step_v1.0_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n\n## 模型文件保存位置\n\n```\nComfyUI-aixiaomo/\n├───📂 ComfyUI_models/\n│   ├───📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├─── minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   │   └─── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├───📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └───📂 vae/\n│       ├─── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│       └─── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n```\n\n⚠ 三个模型约 51GB（扩散 20G + 文本编码器 26G + VAE 5.5G），\n16GB 显存需要 offload，首次加载慢属正常。\n\n## 问题反馈\n **如发现无法下载 等 任何问题 您都可以联系我们**\n\n软件故障-技术服务电话：191 6354 5276 （技术售后）\n\n技术支持-定制业务电话：191 6354 6136 （功能定制）\n\n业务扩展-商务合作电话：191 6354 6326 （商务合作）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "工作流模型说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [860, 760], "pos": [-1661.5009765625, 95.11612701416016], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 分辨率（Resolution Selector：比例 + 百万像素 + multiple=32）\n\n| megapixels | 16:9 实际输出 |\n|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.4 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.7 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 1344 x 768（官方 768p 原生画布） |\n\nH3 原生画布 = 短边 768、面积上限 768×1344、按 32 取整。\n\n## 时长 → 帧数（24fps，17k+5 网格）\n\n公式（工作区里的 Math Expression 节点）：\n`max(5, round(a * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a * 24)) % 17)) % 17`\n\n| 时长 | 帧数 |\n|---|---|\n| 2 s | 56 |\n| 3 s | 73 |\n| 4 s | 107 |\n| 5 s | 124 |\n| 8 s | 192 |\n| 10 s | 243 |\n| 15 s | 362 |\n\n官方训练区间约 124~362 帧（5~15 秒）；更长未验证。\n耗时与帧数成正比，先用 2~3 秒试效果再拉长。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "尺寸/时长参考表", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [860, 644.671875], "pos": [-1657.73779296875, 934.0022583007812], "id": 33, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "seed", "slot_index": 0, "links": [24], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "size": [270, 132], "pos": [-631.7612915039062, 400.05426025390625], "widgets_values": [1, "fixed", null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "easy seed", "title": "随机种子（fixed=复现）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy seed"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "slot_index": 0, "links": [6, 12], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "slot_index": 1, "links": [7, 13], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [320, 190], "pos": [-620.0545043945312, -338.82305908203125], "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 0.4, 32], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTION_PREVIEW", "localized_name": "preview"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "megapixels"}, "name": "megapixels", "label": "megapixels", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "megapixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiple"}, "name": "multiple", "label": "multiple", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "multiple"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "ResolutionSelector", "title": "② 画面比例 / 像素（multiple=32）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"aspect_ratio": true, "megapixels": true, "multiple": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "int", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "int", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [270, 104], "pos": [-618.8689575195312, -40.26319885253906], "widgets_values": [5], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "easy int", "title": "③ 视频时长（秒）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy int"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "int", "slot_index": 0, "links": [34], "label": "int", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [270, 104], "pos": [-620.0089111328125, 184.8651885986328], "widgets_values": [24], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "easy int", "title": "④ 视频帧率", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy int"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}, {"name": "INT", "slot